    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="641d576f-9b40-5421-adb7-a24c797061ce" activityNameId="e5e47ca6-cde6-561d-bc05-5aa2549e603c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Selenium, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Selenium, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of selenium. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 007782-49-2; 
Formula: Se; 
UUID: 19683691-2c8d-3399-ad83-ca0b6d1a4122
Raw materials and auxillaries used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimated emissions to air from production, estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the site (approximation). Water emissions omitted.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production from selenium based on simplified roasting process with sodium carbonate. Inventory bases on stoechiometric calculations - assuming a surplus input of 25%. The emissions to air (0.2 wt.% of raw material input) and water were estimated using mass balances. Treatment of the waste water in a internal waste water treatment plant assumed.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: approximation with data from literature 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_19683691-2c8d-3399-ad83-ca0b6d1a4122.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">RER</shortname>
        <comment>
